Description: Hokku OS desktop defaults: the Gonx look and the session
 The Gonx look for new users (Hokku apps, GTK and Qt), the BeOS pointer, and
 hokku-session, which starts Hokku's desktop with Gonx's plain background.
 Its session entry ("Hokku") takes the place of Hokku's own.
